      29→## Overview
      30→This SDK is designed to interact with the [3x-ui](https://github.com/MHSanaei/3x-ui) app in a more object-oriented way. It provides both synchronous and asynchronous methods to interact with the app. The SDK is designed to be as simple as possible to use, while still providing a lot of flexibility and uses `Pydantic` m…
      31→Used dependencies:
      32→- `requests` for synchronous API
      33→- `httpx` for asynchronous API
      34→- `pydantic` for models
      35→
      36→Supported Python versions:
      37→- 3.11
      38→- 3.12
      39→
      40→Since the 3x-ui app is under development, the SDK may not be compatible with all versions of the app. The developer of SDK is not related to the 3x-ui app, therefore the latest versions of the software are not guaranteed to be compatible with the SDK. <br>
      41→The SDK does not support versions of the 3x-ui older than `2.3.7`.
